        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the world of Squad 17—a team of professional rescuers where every second counts, and no force of nature can stop them, even on their time off! Their latest challenge comes from a blogger named Manon, whose reckless attitude puts operations at risk, forcing the heroes to think outside the box to complete complex and dangerous missions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you will find:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. New characters: Trainee Manon and dispatcher Sugihara Yuna!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. The return of familiar heroes: Firefighters Richard and Ryan, police officer Frank, ranger Roland, and the adorable rescue dogs Angel and Rocky!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Vibrant comic strips that immerse you in the everyday life of real rescuers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Production chains to create even more valuable resources!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5. New types of level tasks for a fully immersive rescue experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6. Exciting new locations from all over the world: a drive-in theater in Mendon, Massachusetts, USA; the Bermuda Islands; Flower Valley in Uttarakhand, India; Zermatt, Switzerland; Mardi Gras in New Orleans, USA; and Japanese onsens!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7. Additional translations into new languages!</p>",
